# LLMWikiOps Repository Rules

Resolve the nearest ancestor `.llmwikiops/config.toml` and read `AGENTS.md`.
First load `.skills/llm-wiki/SKILL.md` as the canonical transaction protocol,
then load the applicable `.skills/<task>/SKILL.md`. The canonical protocol takes
precedence over conflicts. Stop on absent or invalid configuration.
